WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.137
<v><b>A:</b></v> Wow! Lucas Santtana!

00:00:06.889 --> 00:00:08.262
<v><b>B:</b></v> Where’s he from?

00:00:10.737 --> 00:00:12.039
<v><b>A:</b></v> He’s from Brazil.

00:00:14.565 --> 00:00:17.357
<v><b>B:</b></v> Is Lila Downs from Brazil, too?

00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:23.981
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, she isn’t. She’s from Mexico.

00:00:27.941 --> 00:00:28.900
<v><b>B:</b></v> Is she good?

00:00:31.007 --> 00:00:33.079
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, she is. Very good.